    "description": "# SecureVault API Collection\n\nThis collection contains REST API endpoints for the SecureVault application.\n\nSecureVault provides secure document management, authentication, document sharing, permission management, and audit logging.\n\n## Base URL\nhttp://localhost:8080\n\n## Authentication\nProtected endpoints require a valid JWT access token.\n\n## Main API Modules\n- User Registration and Login\n- Token Refresh and Logout\n- Document Upload, List, Search, Filter and Sort\n- Document Preview, Download, Rename and Delete\n- Document Sharing and Permission Management\n- Audit Logs\n- Admin APIs\n\nNote: Access to protected APIs is controlled by backend authentication and authorization.\n\n## Collection Variables\n- `baseUrl`: API base URL\n- `accessToken`: JWT access token for protected endpoints\n- `refreshToken`: refresh token for refresh/logout\n- `documentId` and `shareId`: IDs used by document and sharing requests\n- `recipientEmail`: email address of the share recipient\n- `newFileName`: filename used by the rename request\n- `searchTerm`: filename search text\n",
    "name": "SecureVault",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
